  "details": "I only use it on the desktop, but I will make this proposal as full tracking friends have taken troublesome steps to comply with the world's specifications.\nCan I switch between full tracking, VR, desktop mode in the menu?\nBy allowing them to switch, friends can quickly unify the environment and play the game world.\nOr quickly respond to the world's gimmicks that can not be handled with full tracking.\nAfter the controller's battery runs out, you can seamlessly switch to the desktop and enjoy the rest of the time.",
